  (text "B5 — DIGITAL I/O AND TIMING: 8 x 5 V TTL outputs, 2 fast outputs, bidirectional TRIG (panel SMA), 10 MHz TCXO option" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "29b35c98-9961-5b1d-93f1-1ada99f9a507"))
  (text "74AHCT541 (TTL-compatible inputs accept 3.3 V) buffers DIO1..8 to 5 V; 1 k series per output limits a shorted output to 5 mA (students!). Outputs are static/slow (kHz): 1 k x 100 pF cable = 100 ns. v0.8: TTL1..8 and FASTTTL1/2 leave on the panel link, not on board-edge terminals." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91d40a9f-1e24-503c-8409-1e3a25e3500a"))
  (text "v0.7: DIO1..8 keep their names but are no longer MCU pins — they come from the TCA9535 I2C expander U505 (address 0x20, A0 = A1 = A2 = GND), P00..P07. The 541 runs at +5V_RAW while the expander drives 3.3 V: the AHCT TTL thresholds (VIH 2.0 V) accept that. v0.7d: P10..P13 and P15..P17 = MODULE OUT 1..7 to the panel link J8 (P10..P13 are the ports the four relay gates used); P14 stays EXP_P14, the Johnson-counter /CLR of the NMR receiver; MODULE OUT 8 is reserved (J8 pin 33 not connected)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1e5e150-7e8a-5062-88ec-3374365c0d1a"))
  (text "74HCT125: FAST_OUT1/2 (MCPWM/RMT) -> 49.9 R series -> the panel link -> the two fast SMAs on the panel; drive +-6 mA rated, so a 50 R termination gives ~1 V: fast outs are for high-impedance TTL loads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a7b6c7b-c4f2-5d8e-9f90-0109a0a9f832"))
  (text "TRIG: 74LVC1T45 A = TRIG_IO (3.3 V), B = 5 V side -> 33 R -> TRIG_5V -> panel SMA; DIR (GPIO39) 1 = output. Into a 50 R termination ~2.4 V typ (beyond the rated 32 mA), 5 V into high-Z. BAV99 clamps B to GND/+5V_RAW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "69d3a12d-9f39-54e5-9767-8a226ee330d6"))
  (text "TCXO option (all DNP): clipped-sine 10 MHz -> 1 nF -> Schmitt buffer biased at VCC/2 -> 74LVC1G17 -> JP501 -> GPIO44 (open JP2 on the base sheet when used). VCONT at 1.65 V from a divider." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "60e74ece-a41d-5382-b317-b5bb124ea9d1"))
  (text "TTL1..TTL8 leave this sheet as global labels -> panel link J7 -> the 10-way screw-terminal" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0e94856a-9c2b-55eb-8a1c-d3ee0fb04144"))
  (text "strip on the front panel (TTL1..8 + 2 x GND). The board-edge terminals J501-J505 are gone (v0.8)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 175.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e0155ac7-147a-58b0-b060-3c7b50a06352"))
  (text "FASTTTL1/2 leave this sheet as global labels -> panel link J7 -> the two fast SMAs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250 122 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1b1560d5-771c-5c0a-ae5a-0d19338ed471"))
  (text "on the front panel (49.9 R series). The edge terminals J506/J507 are gone (v0.8)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250 125.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5c5a5af-a8a7-564f-919d-a888e2b99ed3"))
  (text "TRIG_DIR = 1: TRIG_IO drives the SMA (output); 0: SMA -> TRIG_IO (input, 5 V tolerant)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 240 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f5f9ea25-3efd-588e-8019-41a417fdf014"))
  (text "10 MHz timebase option — all parts DNP by default (zero cost); JP501 open until a firmware use exists" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "53962b64-d5d7-55a2-b10b-d9a3cc6d4cc4"))
  (text "U505 TCA9535 (TSSOP-24, address 0x20, A0 = A1 = A2 = GND): the I2C port expander that replaced 12 direct GPIO in v0.7 —" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 197 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c5a1c6e7-3d26-5efe-8427-afbbd5889c0d"))
  (text "P00..P07 = DIO1..8 into the 74AHCT541 above; P10..P13 and P15..P17 = MODULE OUT 1..7, the 3.3 V module outputs, to the panel link J8 (v0.7d)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 200.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "90753050-91e5-5dbd-b4b8-243354fa71f6"))
  (text "P14 is NOT free: it is EXP_P14, the /CLR of the 74HC74 Johnson counter on the NMR receiver sheet (TP501 is its test point). MODULE OUT 8 is" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 204 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "84f87004-0604-5bcd-9a85-396e293d0681"))
  (text "reserved: J8 pin 33 is not connected on this board and the panel pulls it down. MOD1..MOD4 keep the ports the relay gates used, so the firmware" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 207.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1fd6117-274f-5e37-ab26-b5d12270e439"))
  (text "mapping is unchanged. Every port is an input after power-up and after a reset: the pull-down on the panel buffer decides the state of a module." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 211 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b70d39d-aa07-5e78-98e3-b34c7763fb0a"))
